  rate        Float
  totalAmount Float
  condition   String?
  // Set (overriding whatever condition was submitted) when the backend
  // determines, from the original sale's StockMovement/consumptionBreakdown,
  // that this returned quantity traces back to a ProductBatch under an
  // active or completed recall — see RecallService.findRecallForSoldItem /
  // recordRecallAffectedReturn. Never set by client input; a non-null value
  // here is what actually kept this quantity out of saleable stock,
  // regardless of what `condition` says.
  recallId    String?
